urface":"清河王覃","start":28,"end":32,"person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfang:p002:m0050","surface":"覃","start":50,"end":51,"person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021:m0024","start":24,"end":28,"surface":"清河王覃","kind":"person","person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"覃","kind":"person","person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005","text":"穎方恣其欲，而憚長沙王乂在內，遂與河間王顒表請誅後父羊玄之、左將軍皇甫商等，檄乂使就第。乃與顒將張方伐京都，以平原內史陸機為前鋒都督、前將軍、假節。穎次朝歌，每夜矛戟有光若火，其壘井中皆有龍象。進軍屯河南，阻清水為壘，造浮橋以通河北，以大木函盛石，沈之以系橋，名曰石鱉。陸機戰敗，死者甚眾，機又為孟玖所譖，穎收機斬之，夷其三族，語在《機傳》。於是進攻京城。時常山人王輿合眾萬餘，欲襲穎，會乂被執，其黨斬輿降。穎既入京師，復旋鎮於鄴，增封二十郡，拜丞相。河間王顒表穎宜為儲副，遂廢太子覃，立穎為皇太弟，丞相如故，制度一依魏武故事，乘輿服御皆遷於鄴。表罷宿衛兵屬相府，更以王官宿衛。僭侈日甚，有無君之心，委任孟玖等，大失眾望。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":157,"last_line":157,"raw_start":15827,"raw_end":16152,"raw_character_offsets":[15829,15830,15831,15832,15833,15834,15835,15836,15837,15838,15839,15840,15841,15842,15843,15844,15845,15846,15847,15848,15849,15850,15851,15852,15853,15854,15855,15856,15857,15858,15859,15860,15861,15862,15863,15864,15865,15866,15